# Pokedex — project rules

## Stack

- **Next.js 16.2.9** App Router, **React 19**, **TypeScript**, **global CSS** (`src/app/globals.css`) — no Tailwind
- Data: [PokeAPI](https://pokeapi.co/) — no API keys or env vars
- Dev server: **port 3100** (`npm run dev`)
- Reference UI: [pokedex.david-hckh.com](https://pokedex.david-hckh.com/)

## Layout

- Desktop (≥1100px): list left, fixed detail sidebar right (`--detail-width: 440px`)
- Mobile: detail opens as modal with close button
- Organize by domain: `src/components/list`, `detail`, `search`, `shared`; hooks in `src/hooks`; API in `src/lib`

## Theme (do not regress)

- SSR theme via **cookie** (`pokedex-theme`) in async `layout.tsx` + `ThemeProvider`
- **Never** add inline `<script>` or `next/script` in layout for theme init
- `ThemeToggle` uses `useSyncExternalStore` to avoid hydration mismatch

## Scope & docs

- Minimize diff scope; match existing naming and patterns
- Phase/task tracking: `docs/PLAN.md` — update when implementing planned work
- Commit/push only when the user explicitly asks
- After UI changes: run `npm run lint`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `npm run test:e2e`
- Use `.cursor/skills/check-pokedex-ui/` for browser UI checks; `verify-pokedex-task/` for phase verification

## Deploy

- Production: Vercel — see `docs/DEPLOY.md`
